C. Rahman"]}], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed (15 to 0)", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}], "items": {"1": {"title": "Covent Garden Market By-law Update", "number": "1", "content": [{"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by J. Pribil", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by E. Peloza", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That, on the recommendation of the City Clerk, the by-law appended as Appendix \u201cA\u201d to the staff report dated November 19, 2024, being a by-law to fix the number of Directors for the Covent Garden Market Corporation, BE INTRODUCED at the Municipal Council meeting to be held on November 26, 2024, to amend section 2 of the by-law to fix the composition of the board of directors to be nine (9) members, two (2) of whom shall be members of Council.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}], "items": {}, "datetime": "2024-11-19 13:00:00", "attachments": [{"empty_flag": false, "title": "2024-11-19 Staff Report - Covent Garden Market By-law", "url": "https://pub-london.escribemeetings.com/filestream.ashx?DocumentId=112766", "date": "2024-11-19 00:00:00", "local_page": null, "__class__": "Attachment"}], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "2": {"title": "2024 Resident Satisfaction Survey", "number": "2", "content": [{"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by J. Pribil", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by E. Peloza", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That on the recommendation of the City Manager, the report, including the 2024 Resident Satisfaction Survey, as appended to the staff report dated November 19, 2024, BE RECEIVED for information.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}], "items": {}, "datetime": "2024-11-19 13:00:00", "attachments": [{"empty_flag": false, "title": "2024-11-19 Staff Report - 2024 Resident Satisfaction Survey", "url": "https://pub-london.escribemeetings.com/filestream.ashx?DocumentId=112767", "date": "2024-11-19 00:00:00", "local_page": null, "__class__": "Attachment"}], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "3": {"title": "November 2024 Strategic Plan Progress Report", "number": "3", "content": [{"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by J. Pribil", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by E. Peloza", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That, on the recommendation of the City Manager, the report including the 2024 Year-End Progress Report, as appended to the staff report dated November 19, 2024, BE RECEIVED for information.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}], "items": {}, "datetime": "2024-11-19 13:00:00", "attachments": [{"empty_flag": false, "title": "2024-11-19 Staff Report - November 2024 Strategic Plan Progress Report", "url": "https://pub-london.escribemeetings.com/filestream.ashx?DocumentId=112769", "date": "2024-11-19 00:00:00", "local_page": null, "__class__": "Attachment"}], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "4": {"title": "Anti-Black Racism Action Plan", "number": "4", "content": [{"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by J. Pribil", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by E. Peloza", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That, on the recommendation of the City Manager, the following actions be taken with respect towards ending Anti-Black racism:", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "a) \u00a0 \u00a0the recommendations of the Anti-Black Racism Action Plan which are specifically directed towards the Corporation of the City of London BE ENDORSED;", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "b)\u00a0 \u00a0 the Civic Administration BE DIRECTED to undertake the following actions for accountability and implementation:", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "i)\u00a0 \u00a0 create an implementation plan for the Corporation of the City of London actions to end anti-Black racism with activities, responsibilities, timelines, measures, and budget requirements (inclusive of additional funding needs) by April;", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "ii)\u00a0 \u00a0 share recommendations with community organizations, encourage and advise on anti-Black racism initiatives; and", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "iii)\u00a0 \u00a0 continue to build and strengthen meaningful relationship and collaborations with members of the Black community by implementing the recommendations outlined in the action plan.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}], "items": {}, "datetime": "2024-11-19 13:00:00", "attachments": [{"empty_flag": false, "title": "2024-11-19 Staff Report - Anti-Black Racism Action Plan", "url": "https://pub-london.escribemeetings.com/filestream.ashx?DocumentId=112770", "date": "2024-11-19 00:00:00", "local_page": null, "__class__": "Attachment"}], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "5": {"title": "Whole of Community System Response - Q3 Quarterly Report", "number": "5", "content": [{"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by J. Pribil", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by E. Peloza", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That, on the recommendation of the Deputy City Manager, Social and Health Development, the Whole of Community System Response \u2013 Q3 Quarterly Report\u00a0BE RECEIVED for information.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}], "items": {}, "datetime": "2024-11-19 13:00:00", "attachments": [{"empty_flag": false, "title": "2024-11-19 Staff Report - Whole of Community Response", "url": "https://pub-london.escribemeetings.com/filestream.ashx?DocumentId=112768", "date": "2024-11-19 00:00:00", "local_page": null, "__class__": "Attachment"}], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}}, "datetime": "2024-11-19 13:00:00", "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "3": {"title": "Scheduled Items", "number": "3", "content": [{"string": "None.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "items": {}, "datetime": "2024-11-19 13:00:00", "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "4": {"title": "Items for Direction", "number": "4", "content": [], "items": {"7": {"title": "Service Depot Location Update Report", "number": "7", "content": [{"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by S. Franke", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by C. Rahman", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That the following actions be taken with respect to Service Depot Locations:", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "a) \u00a0 \u00a0the Service Depot Location Update Report dated November 19, 2024 BE RECEIVED and no further action be taken;", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "b) \u00a0 \u00a0Civic Administration BE DIRECTED to report back to Community and Protective Services Committee with respect to operationalizing mobile transactional outreach services and act responsively as encampments move around the city; and", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "c) \u00a0 \u00a0 Civic Administration BE DIRECTED to continue with transactional service delivery in existing service depot locations until February 28, 2025.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [{"string": "ADDITIONAL VOTES:", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "__class__": "Motion"}, {"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by D. Ferreira", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by S. Trosow", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That, pursuant to section 27.6 of the Council Procedure By-law, a change in order of the Strategic Priorities and Policy Committee Agenda BE APPROVED, to provide for Item 4.7 in Stage 4, Items for Direction, to be considered after Stage 3, Scheduled Items.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [{"vote": "Yeas:", "voters": ["A. Hopkins", "E. Peloza", "H. McAlister", "P. Cuddy", "S. Stevenson", "J. Pribil", "S. Trosow", "S. Franke", "D. Ferreira"]}, {"vote": "Nays:", "voters": ["J. Morgan", "S. Lewis", "S. Hillier", "P. Van Meerbergen", "S. Lehman", "C. Rahman"]}], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed (9 to 6)", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}, {"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by H. McAlister", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by S. Lehman", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That the Service Depot Location Update Report dated November 19, 2024 BE RECEIVED and no further action be taken.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [{"vote": "Yeas:", "voters": ["J. Morgan", "S. Lewis", "S. Hillier", "E. Peloza", "P. Van Meerbergen", "S. Lehman", "H. McAlister", "P. Cuddy", "S. Stevenson", "J. Pribil"]}, {"vote": "Nays:", "voters": ["A. Hopkins", "S. Trosow", "S. Franke", "D. Ferreira", "C. Rahman"]}], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed (10 to 5)", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}, {"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by A. Hopkins", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That, pursuant to section 32.5 of the Council Procedure By-law, \u201cshall the ruling of the Chair BE SUSTAINED?\u201d", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [{"vote": "Yeas:", "voters": ["J. Morgan", "S. Lewis", "S. Hillier", "E. Peloza", "P. Van Meerbergen", "S. Lehman", "H. McAlister", "P. Cuddy", "S. Stevenson", "J. Pribil", "S. Franke", "C. Rahman"]}, {"vote": "Nays:", "voters": ["A. Hopkins", "S. Trosow", "D. Ferreira"]}], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed (12 to 3)", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}, {"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by J. Pribil", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by D. Ferreira", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That pursuant to section 31.6 of the Council Procedure By-law, Councillor J. Pribil BE PERMITTED to speak an additional one (1) minute with respect to this matter.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [{"vote": "Yeas:", "voters": ["A. Hopkins", "P. Van Meerbergen", "H. McAlister", "P. Cuddy", "S. Stevenson", "J. Pribil", "S. Trosow", "D. Ferreira", "C. Rahman"]}, {"vote": "Nays:", "voters": ["J. Morgan", "S. Lewis", "S. Hillier", "E. Peloza", "S. Lehman", "S. Franke"]}], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed (9 to 6)", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}, {"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by J. Morgan", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by A. Hopkins", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That the motion be amended to add a new part c) and reads as follows:", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "That the following actions be taken with respect to Service Depot Locations:", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "a) \u00a0 \u00a0the Service Depot Location Update Report dated November 19, 2024 BE RECEIVED and no further action be taken;", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "b)\u00a0 Civic Administration BE DIRECTED to report back to Community and Protective Services Committee with respect to operationalizing mobile transactional outreach services and act responsively as encampments move around the city; and", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "c) that Civic Administration BE DIRECTED to continue with transactional service delivery in existing service depot locations until further direction is provided by Municipal Council.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}, {"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by J. Pribil", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by S. Lehman", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That the motion be further amended in part c) to include \"until February 28, 2025\" and delete \"until further direction is provided by Municipal Council\"", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [{"vote": "Yeas:", "voters": ["J. Morgan", "E. Peloza", "P. Van Meerbergen", "S. Lehman", "H. McAlister", "P. Cuddy", "S. Stevenson", "J. Pribil", "S. Trosow", "S. Franke", "D. Ferreira", "C. Rahman"]}, {"vote": "Nays:", "voters": ["A. Hopkins", "S. Lewis", "S. Hillier"]}], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed (12 to 3)", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}, {"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by J. Morgan", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by A. Hopkins", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That the motion be amended with parts b) and c) to read as follows:", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "b)\u00a0 Civic Administration BE DIRECTED to report back to Community and Protective Services Committee